{"id":"f479810b099813df00ffbffb5f255e77f21e9834","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1234943","title":"claude 被封后，会不会往项目目录里写记号，导致下次的新号被连坐？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"blackantt","excerpt":"Claude - @blackantt - 想把 windows 重装，换 ip ，重新买号。 但不知道这家伙会否已经在项目目录里已经做了记号？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>想把 windows 重装，换 ip ，重新买号。 但不知道这家伙会否已经在项目目录里已经做了记号？</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/账号\"><li></li> 账号</a><a href=\"/tag/封禁\"><li></li> 封禁</a><a href=\"/tag/关联\"><li></li> 关联</a></P><p><span>25 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-18 01:22:22 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981411\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0274d58b991d9117edc2db46df13cba0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ccc008\" data-uid=\"88836\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ccc008\">ccc008</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 11:39:01 +08:00\">14h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>其它不说。他可能会读取机器码</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981436\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ee81/825c/388657_normal.png?m=1715389187\" alt=\"whoosy\" data-uid=\"388657\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/whoosy\">whoosy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 11:43:21 +08:00\">14h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>放心，同一个机器上被封过号，后面这个机器就别想再开号了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981458\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ee81/825c/388657_normal.png?m=1715389187\" alt=\"whoosy\" data-uid=\"388657\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/whoosy\">whoosy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 11:47:06 +08:00\">14h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果真想用 claude 订阅，网上找找国外公司办公人员经常使用的云桌面服务，从这上面去用 claude code ，这玩意和 ip 关系不大</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981483\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/683e/710d/583505_normal.png?m=1776159443\" alt=\"lyxxxh2\" data-uid=\"583505\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lyxxxh2\">lyxxxh2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 11:50:21 +08:00\">14h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>被封过 3 个号:<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1224921\">https://www.v2ex.com/t/1224921</a><br>前两天昨天又被封一个号(可能是我用 cux 自动切换,被判定为农场操作)</p><p>我现在还有 4 个号坚挺,如果要是根据设备,我早没了。<br>真这么做,记得的你硬盘 id 之类的,重装也没用。<br>说到这,我想起用 wps 创建的文件,都记录硬盘 id...<br>只希望 claude 别学国产。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981509\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/90a4/c283/228831_normal.png?m=1721937386\" alt=\"longxk\" data-uid=\"228831\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/longxk\">longxk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 11:54:10 +08:00\">14h 15m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/lyxxxh2\">lyxxxh2</a> 换个思路，是不是也可以让 Anthropic 认为你是一个在中国工作的美国人？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981566\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/683e/710d/583505_normal.png?m=1776159443\" alt=\"lyxxxh2\" data-uid=\"583505\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lyxxxh2\">lyxxxh2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 12:03:51 +08:00\">14h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/longxk\">longxk</a> <br>反了吧,是让 Anthropic 认为你在海外工作的中国人。<br>封号主体是区域。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981728\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f6b3/7360/22839_normal.png?m=1702881883\" alt=\"jimrok\" data-uid=\"22839\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jimrok\">jimrok</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 12:44:48 +08:00\">13h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>以 A\\的文化来看，它会用尽手段的，如果能往项目写点东西帮助他识别你，为什么不干呢？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981741\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f6b3/7360/22839_normal.png?m=1702881883\" alt=\"jimrok\" data-uid=\"22839\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jimrok\">jimrok</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 12:47:33 +08:00\">13h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>上次 claudcode 被扒出用 unicode 隐写了日期信息，可见是多么醉心于这类技能，通过这些小技巧把你给屏蔽了，他们隔着屏幕都能笑出来。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17981744\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/003f1b50994eb31aeb26105920380e3a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"blackantt\" data-uid=\"215985\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/blackantt\">blackantt</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 12:48:03 +08:00\">13h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/whoosy\">whoosy</a> 关键是开号时的支付。 淘宝上的商家估计用黑卡的多，我怀疑我被连坐了。 环境搞得再好，被支付方绊住了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982253\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2609/0083/145420_normal.png?m=1718590514\" alt=\"catamaran\" data-uid=\"145420\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/catamaran\">catamaran</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 14:19:05 +08:00\">11h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>claude 生成的文件是有指纹的，前些天新闻上说了，指纹散落在文件内容中</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982643\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/367b/fdbe/43850_normal.png?m=1777084318\" alt=\"ddter\" data-uid=\"43850\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ddter\">ddter</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 15:25:33 +08:00\">10h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有硬件 id ，重装系统都不会变的那种，但是有 bug 。他会先判断是否生成已经生成的就不会生成了，所以你可以先下手为强造一个，这个我在三月大封号的时候逆向出来的，目前 20x 一切正常。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982883\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/367b/fdbe/43850_normal.png?m=1777084318\" alt=\"ddter\" data-uid=\"43850\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ddter\">ddter</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 16:12:47 +08:00\">9h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/feifeichen\">feifeichen</a> 设备 id 的处理 = 换掉两个上报用的随机 ID （ userID / anonymousId ）+ 删掉持久设备指纹（ statsig stable_id ）和遥测里的 device_id 哈希，核心目的是让新账号在服务器看来像是一台全新设备，切账号时不被指纹关联而连坐封号。这个还是三四月之前搞的，不知道后面有没有变化过，你可以让别的 ci 去研究下 claude code 代码。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982893\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d3203a0d2df4bdc5381a2e4e62c510ff?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"IlIl\" data-uid=\"504788\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/IlIl\">IlIl</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 16:14:21 +08:00\">9h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>封了就别用了吧 现在好像封了都不退钱了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982954\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1bc5/39b9/494800_normal.png?m=1775044279\" alt=\"feifeichen\" data-uid=\"494800\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/feifeichen\">feifeichen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 16:24:37 +08:00\">9h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/ddter\">ddter</a> 我发了一个 hi ，然后这个包里看到的身份标识只有 device_id ，account_uuid ，organization_uuid ，session_id ，device_id 上报的值是 userid ，anonymousId/anonymous_id 是空串，也没上报。目前来看和硬件的关系不大</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17982988\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/662a/8733/431846_normal.png?m=1784118562\" alt=\"xidaduo\" data-uid=\"431846\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xidaduo\">xidaduo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 16:30:58 +08:00\">9h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/whoosy\">whoosy</a> 谁跟你说的😅，为什么不经验证的结论可以这么信誓旦旦地说出来？我一个号被封了，但是重新开了一个号没问题，而且我一台机器现在开了两个 Claude ，一个在 Desktop 中使用， 一个在 CLI 中使用，两个号依旧好好的。</p><p>Claude 的风控依旧是个黑盒，任何结论都是不靠谱的。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17983722\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5c43/ef5e/798826_normal.png?m=1786972593\" alt=\"fengshao1227\" data-uid=\"798826\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/fengshao1227\">fengshao1227</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 19:09:02 +08:00\">7h 0m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>claude 会有一些标记，可以让 codex 帮你清理一下，会话里面有人说是会影响的，让全删不过我自己没有删过，被封了 3 个号了好像，</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17984378\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2124c8aba1b20643d71a5101a519a80d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zerovoid\" data-uid=\"263784\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zerovoid\">zerovoid</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-18 01:22:22 +08:00\">47 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>以 a/的作风，今天不做，不代表明天不做。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"想把 windows 重装，换 ip ，重新买号。 但不知道这家伙会否已经在项目目录里已经做了记号？ 账号 封禁 关联25 replies • 2026-08-18 01:22:22 +08:00 1 ccc008 14h 31m ago 其它不说。他可能会读取机器码 2 whoosy 14h 26m ago 放心，同一个机器上被封过号，后面这个机器就别想再开号了 3 whoosy 14h 22m ago 如果真想用 claude 订阅，网上找找国外公司办公人员经常使用的云桌面服务，从这上面去用 claude code ，这玩意和 ip 关系不大 4 lyxxxh2 14h 19m ago 被封过 3 个号:https://www.v2ex.com/t/1224921前两天昨天又被封一个号(可能是我用 cux 自动切换,被判定为农场操作)我现在还有 4 个号坚挺,如果要是根据设备,我早没了。真这么做,记得的你硬盘 id 之类的,重装也没